WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.910
A region with two parts: a city,
and the countryside around it.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.070
Every year, ten per cent of city
dwellers move out to the country.

3
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.580
And five per cent of country
dwellers move into the city.

4
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.790
Year one, year two, year three.

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.830
The bars rise and fall.

6
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.280
Keep going for years and years.

7
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.740
Where do the two populations end up?

8
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.980
In this mission, you'll build a matrix
that turns this year's populations into

9
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.170
next year's.

10
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:31.420
You'll multiply by the same
matrix again and again,

11
00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.840
and find a matrix's
eigenvalues and eigenvectors.

12
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.920
Your mission: find the final
split between city and country.
